OL,3,AActress Selma Blair faces charges for
OL,4,Akicking nurse and officer after plane
OL,5,Aincident
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS actress Selma Blair has been charged
OL,8,Fwith two additional assault counts over
OL,9,Fallegedly kicking an officer and a
OL,10,Fnurse after being removed from a
OL,11,Fflight.
OL,13,FBlair was arrested late Sunday in New
OL,14,FYork after she allegedly attacked
OL,15,Fflight attendants on a Delta plane
OL,16,Ftravelling from Los Angeles to New
OL,17,FYork. The FBI issued her a federal
OL,18,Fsummons accusing her of assault on
OL,19,Fboard.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
