OL,3,AActress Selma Blair faces charges for
OL,4,Akicking nurse and officer after plane
OL,5,Aincident
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile appearing in court over the
OL,8,Fadditional charges, the Legally Blonde
OL,9,Fstar's attorney asked the judge to
OL,10,Fconsider the actress's "body of work",
OL,11,Fand called Blair the "gold standard."
OL,12,FThe judge said she should not "get
OL,13,Fspecial treatment".
OL,15,FBlair has pleaded not guilty. She has
OL,16,Fsince been released on bail.
